positioning: manual

event start none "Begin" as s at (20, 60) size (50, 50)
task "Wide task" as t1 at (120, 40) size (200, 80)
gateway exclusive "Check" as g1 at (380, 45) size (70, 70)
task "Narrow" as t2 at (500, 50) size (80, 50)
event end none "Fin" as e at (640, 60)

s -> t1
t1 -> g1
g1 -> t2: "ok"
t2 -> e
